<div v-pre>
<h1>MPU6050 IMU Sensor</h1>
<p class="subtitle">A 6-DOF (Degrees of Freedom) Inertial Measurement Unit featuring a 3-axis accelerometer and a 3-axis gyroscope. Communicates via I2C. Essential for motion tracking and balancing robots.</p>
